    <string name="rules_goal_title">Goal</string>
    <string name="rules_goal">Clear the board by removing all tiles in matching pairs.</string>
    <string name="rules_free_title">Free tiles</string>
    <string name="rules_free">You can only take a tile that is free: no other tile lies on top of it, even partly, and its left or right side is open. Tiles stuck between neighbours on both sides cannot be taken. Shaded tiles are not free yet.</string>
    <string name="rules_matching_title">Matching</string>
    <string name="rules_matching">Tap two free tiles that are identical to remove them. The four flowers all match each other, and so do the four seasons.</string>
    <string name="rules_help_title">When you are stuck</string>
    <string name="rules_help">Every deal can be solved. If no pairs are left, undo some moves or shuffle the remaining tiles. Hint shows you a pair you can take right now.</string>
    <string name="rules_controls_title">Controls</string>
    <string name="rules_controls">Tap a tile to select it, then tap its pair. Pinch to zoom in on large layouts, and drag with one finger to move around.</string>
